# Juriscore API — local development

Copy to `.env` and adjust as needed.

```env
# SQLite file (optional; defaults to api/data/app.db locally)
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite+aiosqlite:///./api/data/app.db

# Auth
JWT_SECRET=change-me-in-production

# CORS (comma-separated origins, or * for local)
CORS_ORIGINS=*

# Set true only if you want kenyalaw.org crawler to start on boot
AUTO_CRAWL=false

# Optional AI backends
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# NVIDIA_API_KEY=
# NVIDIA_NIM_MODEL=nvidia/llama-3.1-nemotron-70b-instruct

# Optional Redis
# REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
```

## Run

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn api.backend.main:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
```

Docs: http://localhost:8000/api/v1/docs
Health: http://localhost:8000/health
